1128:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API processes the status of the CSD/CSX Button widget and
1129:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   CSX Matrix Button widget. It applies the hysteresis and de-bounce algorithm
1130:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   to each sensor difference value. This API is expected to be called
