1212:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * Function Name: CapSense_DpProcessProximity
1213:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** ****************************************************************************//**
1214:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1215:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * \brief
1216:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   Processes the status of the Proximity widget.
1217:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1218:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * \details
1219:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API processes the status of the CSD Proximity widget. It applies the
1220:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   hysteresis and debounce algorithm to each sensor difference value.
1221:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   The proximity and touch events are considered independently so debounce and
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\ccNkNELR.s 			page 29


1222:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   hysteresis are also applied independently.
1223:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1224:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API is expected to be called after each new widget scan. If it is
1225:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   called multiple times for the same scan data the debounce algorithm
1226:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   will not work properly.
1227:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1228:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API does not update any Data Structure registers
1229:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   except the debounce counters.
1230:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1231:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * \param currStatus   The value with the current widget status.
1232:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * \param ptrFlashWdgt The pointer to the Flash Widget Object.
1233:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1234:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * \return
1235:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *  Returns the status of the proximity sensors. Each sensor is represented by two bits
1236:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *  that can take the following values:
1237:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   - 00b not active
1238:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   - 01b proximity is detected (signal is above finger threshold)
1239:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   - 11b finger touch is detected (signal is above the touch threshold)
1240:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1241:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *******************************************************************************/
1242:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** uint32 CapSense_DpProcessProximity(uint32 currStatus, CapSense_FLASH_WD_STRUCT const *ptrFlashWdgt)
1243:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** {
