1332:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** * \details
1333:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API processes the status of the CSD Slider widget (Linear and Radial).
1334:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   It applies the hysteresis and de-bounce algorithm to the widget ignoring
1335:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   the individual states of the sensors.
