1336:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1337:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API is expected to be called after each new widget scan. If it is
1338:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   called multiple times for the same scan data, the debounce algorithm
1339:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   will not work properly.
1340:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1341:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   Slider widgets do not support the ON to OFF debounce.
1342:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *
1343:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   This API does not update any Data Structure registers
1344:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Processing.c **** *   except the debounce counters.
